WEBVTT

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:14.970
To think that an older generation
Neo-Gene could injure her...

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.640
Maria was in the middle of fine-tuning.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:23.810
With further training,
things should no longer end this way.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:28.770
Tell Nishida to train her well.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.780
This is the very latest data.

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:40.240
Now our team's victory is as good as certain.

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:43.370
I expect the usual compensation.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.870
Yes. It should already be transferred over.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.040
I see.

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:52.300
What? You're leaving already?

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:54.260
I have lots of work to do.

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:57.970
I want an environment in which
I can focus on my research.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.980
Just you watch, Takayama...

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:40.990
"Relaxation"

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:46.080
You're going on a trip, Chou-san?

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:50.830
Yeah! A two-day, one-night
group date tour to a fancy resort

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:52.920
with hot college girls!

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.790
Group date tour?!

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:57.750
Yeah! I helped Tozawa-Chan out the other day,

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:01.680
and asked him to repay me in group date form!

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:05.600
Oh? I didn't know he had
connections with college girls!

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:10.060
So, since this doesn't happen
often, I splurged and went all out!

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:13.350
Oh? So you can't pay your rent,

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.650
but you can pay for group dates, huh?!

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:19.070
Oh, you know, "That's that, this is this..."

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:20.360
No more excuses!

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:24.360
Pay your three months in full, this minute!

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:25.740
T-Three?!

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:29.870
Swimming in the ocean sounds so fun!

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:31.960
We can go swimming nearby, if you want!

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.670
Eh?! Really?!

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:36.340
The Metro Pool should be open now!

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:39.050
And then we can get
yummy food on the way home!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.210
I'm all for it!
Honestly...

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.880
Alright! Let's do that!
Honestly...

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:43.880
What do you wanna eat, Riko?

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:46.300
Hmm... ramen!
Can't you act your age?!

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:47.760
You want ramen?
Yeah!

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:51.060
Honestly, Rihoko...
Then why don't you two come with me?

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.230
Eh?!
Eh?!

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.560
My treat, of course!

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:56.730
The occasional family outing, you know?

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:57.560
Rent!

00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:03.360
Naturally, you and Naomi-bou
are invited on this gorgeous trip, too!

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:06.530
Yay! All of us on a trip?!
Are you sure?

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.370
No problem at all!

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:11.910
And I'll get you a
really revealing bikini, too!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.790
Can you buy a swimsuit for Riko, too?

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:17.080
You bet! I'll buy anything at this point!

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:21.670
This is great! This'll be my first
time swimming in the ocean, Mom!

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:25.680
Personally, I'd just like
to have the rent paid...

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:28.350
Oh, so you're not going?

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:30.310
I never said that!

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:34.640
The key to good fortune is in
a flower-patterned swimsuit...

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:37.100
You guys're especially lively today...

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:40.900
You did great, setting up
a group date with college girls!

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:43.860
Oh, is that out already?

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:47.360
Though technically, they
might not be college girls...

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:50.780
That's fine if you bring more people.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:52.790
After all, you're paying for it.

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:55.500
Anyway, I'm counting on you to bring the girls!

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:57.170
It'll cost you!

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:01.630
How does one-third your usual
rate on your next scoop sound?

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.460
Gimme a break here!

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:07.800
Jokes aside, I've spoken with
the girls in the editing department.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:12.390
What are they like?

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:15.060
You'll just have to find out!

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.890
But more importantly, what about you?

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:18.940
Me?

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:23.190
Isn't it about time you start
thinking about the future?

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:28.860
It's been six years since the quake, you know.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:30.780
Just bring the girls, okay?

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:37.080
Chief! About tomorrow's meeting...

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.790
Right. I'll be right there!

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:42.000
"Natsuki Building Group"

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.920
Hurry up everybody!

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:47.090
What's taking you so long?!

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:50.260
Calm down, will ya?!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.850
I was so excited that I
couldn't sleep last night!

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:54.010
Me neither!

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:56.640
A-Actually, neither could I...

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:05.230
Good morning! Are you
from the Natsuki Building?

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:07.610
Yeah... Are you the ones ?

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:10.820
Supple!

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:11.870
Long!

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:12.870
Firm!

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.280
Yes!

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.950
I'm Sasaki Kyoko!

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:19.500
I look forward to joining you today!

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:21.630
It's nice to meet you!

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.800
I never expected this...

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:30.220
Hello!

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:34.810
Morning, Tozawa-kun! This's all yours!

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:35.680
Huh?

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.720
Trip photos. Take good ones, now!

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:41.230
Why me?! Besides, I hate digital cameras!

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:43.810
No complaining!

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:46.270
Make sure they come out good!

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:49.860
Where's Masamune?

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.570
Mom's going to come later.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:54.200
She had something to do at work first.

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:57.410
Could you make it quick?

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.870
I'm about to go on a fun family trip!

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:02.790
Yes, yes. Just hold on.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:10.220
All right. Here's your pay for
defeating the previous X-Cons.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:12.880
Thank you!

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:16.930
I'll get you guys a souvenir, too!
What do you want?

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:18.850
There's no need to act nice.

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:23.190
You earned the money. Use it for yourselves.

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.770
Thanks. Well, see ya!

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:28.440
Wait. We need to talk.

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.940
What is it? I'm in a hurry...

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:35.200
It's important... It's about the Witchblade.

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:42.790
Thanks so much for inviting us today!

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.880
I guess you really are rich, Chou-san!

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:48.550
Oh, no, I'm... richer than rich!

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:50.880
I like you so much!

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:52.090
Nanako-san!

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.800
It's rude to talk like that
when you first meet someone!

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:59.930
Whatever! You know you're out
to get Chou-san, too, Satomi!

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:05.440
I'm, uhh, just bad with computers,
so I think he's wonderful!

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:09.020
In that case, why don't I teach
you about computers some time?

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:11.610
Really?! I'm so happy!

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:19.910
Anyways, Chou-san, how about
a swimming race out to the ocean?

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:25.120
Great idea! I work out everyday,
so I'm a pretty confident swimmer!

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:29.210
A life devoted to sports... So ideal!

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:32.090
I hope I can grow older that way, too!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:36.970
Miki-Chan's so unfair!
I refuse to let her beat me!

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.140
That's impressive!

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:41.060
What do they see in that old pervert?

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:45.100
Once they heard he amassed
a huge fortune with an IT business...

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:51.400
...and owns hotels and hot springs
of his own, they just went crazy!

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:54.780
Kid! That's way too made-up!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.780
Not my fault!

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:59.660
It's the only way anyone'd
pay attention to that geezer!

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:01.790
That'll come back to bite you eventually...

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:05.160
Hey, that Tozawa guy's pretty cool!

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:06.790
Does he have a girlfriend?!

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:10.960
A girlfriend? Hmm, I'm not sure...

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:15.130
If a guy like him's working for my
mom, she should bring him home!

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:18.220
Maybe I'll be daring and call out to him!

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:25.350
You've seen how these
Neo-Genes die on several occasions.

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:26.600
Yes...

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:33.150
The Cloneblades' excessive abilities...

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:35.820
...put an intense burden on their wearers.

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:42.410
Their bodies eventually break down...
and are ultimately destroyed.

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:47.210
And that probably happens to wearers
of the original Witchblade, too.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:54.250
You mean... I'm going to
wind up like that sometime?

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:59.630
Yes, if you continue to use
the Witchblade as you have been.

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:03.430
If you want to survive,
avoid any unnecessary fighting.

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:06.220
I realize you want to earn
money for your daughter's sake,

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:10.810
but don't forget that you're
also the only mother she has.

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.820
I know.

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:18.900
That's right! You need to live
a long life for Rihoko-Chan!

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:24.240
After all, if you should die,
the Witchblade will be passed on to her!

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:25.080
Eh?!

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.660
Segawa!

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:32.710
Eh? But Reina-san's compatibility
did drop after having Rihoko-Chan.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:35.210
What's he mean?! Explain!

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:43.800
Six years ago, during her
collaboration with Douji,

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:47.930
Sohou Reina showed very high
compatibility with the Witchblade.

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:51.390
But after she gave birth,
those numbers dropped sharply.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:56.650
Which means the high compatibility
probably wasn't because of her,

00:10:56.730 --> 00:11:02.320
but because of the daughter
inside of her... Rihoko.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:08.240
In short, you're a temporary wearer
until Rihoko-Chan grows up.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:09.750
You can't be serious!

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:16.880
Rihoko is going to...

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:19.260
I apologize.

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:23.890
I naturally thought that
Masane-san had realized it...

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.640
I refuse...

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:31.100
I absolutely refuse...

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:32.770
...to let that happen.

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:36.310
If anyone ever tries to
put this thing on Rihoko...

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:37.770
...I will kill them!

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:45.740
The shining sun...

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:47.240
The glittering waves...

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.870
The white sand...

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:53.830
And... And the throngs of hot-bodied girls!

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:55.790
Tadah! Tadah!

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:57.210
What the hell is that?!

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:01.050
How rude!

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:05.890
Let's go! The ocean is calling our names!

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:06.640
Let's go, let's go!

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:09.850
Chou-san is going to eat shaved ice with me!

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:12.640
We'll share one cup and eat it together!

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:15.270
You wish! Chou-san is coming with me!

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:17.900
No, buy me shaved ice!

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:21.400
Now, now, you two! Let's be happy, okay?

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:22.740
Umm, Chou-san.

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:25.780
If it's not too much trouble,
could you put oil on me?

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:29.830
Yeah! I'll oil you! I'll oil you up good!

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:34.790
Chou-san, is it true that
you own this entire beach?

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:39.670
Eh?! Oh, uhh, I guess, maybe, yeah...

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:43.970
Put oil on me, too!
I'll give you a massage!

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:46.470
Chou-san is so deeply moved!

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:47.930
Talk about going too far...

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:52.350
Go get 'em! Don't let
Chou-san have them all!

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:54.020
Too much of a bother...

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:55.350
You've withered.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:57.810
I don't remember you
having employees like them...

00:12:57.900 --> 00:12:59.310
Chou-san!

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:00.900
My employees?

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:02.190
Please take us with you!

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:09.240
Hey! Let's all have fun together!
Huh?

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:14.200
M-Me, in a swimsuit...
I knew I shouldn't have come...

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:18.670
Don't worry! It's really
cute and suits you well!

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:20.540
A-Are you sure?

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:22.800
What's the big holdup?

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:28.180
We're at the beach!

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:30.850
No need to be embarrassed! Honestly, now!

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:33.810
Naomi-Chan?! Ugh!

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:53.740
Wow! You hit it right in
the center again, Riko-Chan!

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:54.950
Is there some kind of trick to it?!

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:56.160
Hmm...

00:13:56.250 --> 00:14:00.420
I just sort of aim where it seems right.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.090
Okay! I'll do that too!

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:05.960
Hold on. I think we've done enough.

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:08.470
You're all too weak!

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:11.390
The true watermelon-smashing
is just beginning!

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:12.760
Hear its name in awe!

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:16.060
Lovey-Dovey Tag Watermelon Smashing!

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:18.020
Lovey-Dovey Tag?

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:20.900
Oh, you're so heavy!

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:24.320
Now where's the watermelon? Is it over here?

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.320
Or is it here?!

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:31.660
Oh, Chou-san! You're so naughty!

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:34.490
That has nothing to do with tag...
How dare you!

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:38.620
This is a team sport that
combines traditional Japanese art

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:40.420
with watermelon-smashing!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.920
Your dirty thoughts are
so obvious, you old perv!

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.670
I'm sorry.
Yeah!

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:49.590
Show some restraint! There're children present!

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:50.800
Mom!

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:54.600
I finally caught up to ya!

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:57.720
I got a bonus, so I used the bullet train!

00:14:57.810 --> 00:15:00.600
Well, Riko? Is the ocean fun?
Very!

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:03.610
Guess what?!
I made friends with Yuuki-Chan!

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:10.450
Her mom is hot! Way different from mine!

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:11.610
What was that?!

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:14.410
You're completely different!
Like your chests and stuff!

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:17.200
Is that the kind of stuff
that comes out of this mouth?!

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:22.620
The whole gang's finally here...

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:29.210
Masamune-Chan really does
have a gorgeous, dynamite body!

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:33.220
I'm sorry!

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:38.220
Wow! It's rare to see
you taking regular photos!

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:43.900
Had it forced on me, even though
I told her I hate digital cameras.

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:46.480
Can't defy the news editor, huh?

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.020
Does she have something on you?

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:51.190
No. We're just old acquaintances.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:54.910
Thanks.
Huh?

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:59.120
You only owe Chou-san
because you were trying to help us...

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.750
It was for the scoop.

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:04.420
I expect an exclusive interview sometime!

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.460
My interviews aren't cheap, you know!

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:07.590
Say what?!

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:09.500
Riko! Let's have lunch!

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:11.210
Okay!

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:20.310
What do you suppose they were talking about?

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:21.770
Who knows...

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:25.600
I guess I'm no match for grownup charm...

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:28.310
You have plenty of charm yourself, Yuuki.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:30.650
Urgh! Acting like you don't care!

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:33.740
With some polishing up, you
could still catch guys too, you know!

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:35.950
Go find a good man already!

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:37.370
Yes, ma'am.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:46.620
I haven't done this in so long...

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:53.130
It's hard when you're working...
I hear you're a single mother, too?

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:57.390
Yeah... I could never really
take her on trips until now...

00:16:57.470 --> 00:16:59.850
It really puts a burden on you, huh?

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:02.850
You want to have as much
together-time as possible,

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:05.850
but sometimes it just doesn't work out...

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:07.940
What do you do when that happens?

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.690
Love, of course!

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:13.900
I give enough love to make
up for the sadness I caused!

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:15.070
With all my might!

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:16.950
Love...

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:20.030
I'd say you've been doing that naturally.

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:22.200
I can tell by looking at Riko-Chan.

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:24.750
She's my treasure.

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:28.460
I bet I could do anything for Rihoko.

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:29.830
I know how that feels.

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:31.880
No matter how exhausted I might be,

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:35.590
when I see Yuuki's face, I feel
like I can take on the world.

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:37.220
I know how that is!

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:41.550
Chou-san! I heard that you
also have a resort hotel in Bali!

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.970
I'd love to go scuba diving!

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.770
B-Bali, huh...

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:47.640
Something seems suspicious.

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:50.770
Say, Chou-san, are you really super-rich?

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:52.940
Nanako-san! Don't be rude!

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:59.660
But he doesn't seem to have a yacht,
and he doesn't run this hotel...

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:01.200
Something's not right!

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:03.160
Well, Chou-san?!

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:05.620
Uhh, umm...

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:11.670
It's Michael! I thought I recognized him!

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:15.050
No way! Whoa, it's really Michael!

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:19.260
I never imagined I'd meet
the Michael-sama in a place like this!

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:22.350
Eh? Michael's that famous?

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:24.350
You don't know who he is?!

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:28.520
Only super-lame people've
never heard of Michael!

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:30.650
You may appear young on the outside,

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:33.940
but you're just an old man on the inside!

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:36.030
Michael! Let's swim together!

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:39.780
Michael... Truly formidable...

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:47.790
Look, look, Riko-Chan!

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.580
It looks like candy!

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:51.620
It does!

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.750
So pretty!

00:18:56.840 --> 00:19:01.970
Oh, those are the kind that fit together!

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:03.800
Wow!

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:04.930
Did you know?

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:06.850
Shells that fit perfectly together...

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:10.890
...mean that you'll never have
to leave someone you love!

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:13.650
Someone you love?
Yeah!

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:17.070
So you should give them to someone
you never want to be away from!

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:18.940
It'll be a good luck charm!

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:20.650
I should find some, too!

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:25.780
And then when I get a boyfriend
someday, I can give them to him!

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:33.920
Mom!

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:36.500
We should head back to the hotel!

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:38.420
I bet you're hungry!

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:39.760
Yeah!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:42.590
Did you find lots of shells?

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:45.760
Yeah! I'm gonna make
them into a necklace later!

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:48.680
Here you go, Mom! For you!

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:50.770
What is it?

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:53.940
Oh, it's so pretty! Can I really have this?

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:54.810
Yeah!

00:19:54.900 --> 00:20:01.900
Yuuki-Chan said it means you'll never
have to leave someone you love!

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:04.780
Now we'll always be together, Mom!

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:09.370
Really?! Thanks! I'll
take good care of it, Riko!

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:14.620
The summer ocean...
Tearful memories... I'm full of tears...

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:25.470
Okay! Sparklers are next!

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:28.640
Thanks, Chou-san!

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:31.810
You're the only one I have, Rihoko-Chan!

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:35.850
Save the lectures.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.560
What're you acting all big for?

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:40.900
But I saw you earlier!

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:44.740
I get a pretty good feeling
about you and Masane-san!

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:46.910
Huh?!

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:51.370
Masane-san's so nice.
She's young, yet with-it and admirable...

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:53.660
Kyoko-san fully endorses her!

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:57.170
Don't be stupid! I don't see her that way!

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.670
Whatever you say!

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:03.630
You had such a gentle look when
you were photographing those two!

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:06.220
Mom!

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:09.640
Okay! I'm coming!

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:13.640
Dunno how she got that idea...

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:18.600
Secret technique! Rapid Fire!

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:22.230
Ooh!

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:25.110
They're so pretty!
Yeah!

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:28.320
Riko, did you have fun?

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:32.990
Yeah! Lots! I hope we can
all come again sometime!

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:37.420
Yeah! Let's definitely come again!

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:54.740
I turn around half-asleep as my hits the right side of my cheek

00:21:54.740 --> 00:22:02.990
Your voice was there, and the air was warm

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:11.260
Your right hand grazes my left shoulder

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.730
But why don't you hold on tight?

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:28.500
In order to change yesterday's wish tomorrow,

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:35.690
I need to grow stronger myself

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:44.840
Even now, I am breathing in your scent, ...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:53.510
and jumping over to your side. Give me your love.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:02.990
Extend your hands. Reach them out to me.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:09.540
I'm so happy

00:23:11.760 --> 00:23:14.720
Swimming in the ocean was so fun, Mom!

00:23:14.810 --> 00:23:17.970
My sunburns sure hurt
when I got into the bath!

00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:20.560
l hope l see Yuuki-chan again!

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:24.110
But Mom, you said we should
go somewhere again sometime,

00:23:24.190 --> 00:23:27.780
but I know you're busy with work,
so don't strain yourself.

00:23:27.860 --> 00:23:32.660
I say that because you've
seemed kind of strange lately.

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:34.200
The beach was fun,

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:39.790
but I like being with you much more
than going on trips or shopping!
